 "description": "<p>Four pieces make this flight attendant costume read as a uniform: hat, bow tie, dress, and thong, all in airline blue chiffon. The hat is the piece that carries the fantasy - without it, a blue dress is just a blue dress.</p>\n<p>The bow tie adds the formality the genre needs, and the dress is cut with the straight, serviceable line the costume references. Chiffon keeps it light enough for a full evening.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: chiffon</li>\n<li>Includes: hat, bow tie, dress, thong</li>\n<li>Style: flight attendant</li>\n<li>Color: blue</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fits 40-60 kg. A travel-themed classic that needs nothing beyond the four pieces in the bag.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Blue chiffon flight attendant set with hat, bow tie, dress and thong, one size for 40-60 kg.</p>\n",
